THIRD-PARTY ASSET — Forbidden & Arcanus GUI texture

  src/main/resources/resourcepacks/forgeink_overrides/assets/
      forbidden_arcanus/textures/gui/container/hephaestus_forge.png

This file is a **modified version of the Hephaestus Forge container texture
from Forbidden & Arcanus**, by **stal111** (https://github.com/stal111/
Forbidden-Arcanus). The edit re-labels the forge's experience gauge to read as
Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks ink, which is what this mod changes the forge to
consume.

It is a derivative of stal111's artwork and is **NOT** part of the public
domain dedication above. Forbidden & Arcanus publishes no licence file, so its
assets are under the author's reserved rights by default. This file is included
here for interoperability and is credited to its original author.

Anyone redistributing or reusing this repository should be aware that this one
file carries the upstream author's rights, not ours, and should seek stal111's
permission for any use beyond running the mod alongside Forbidden & Arcanus.
Removing that single PNG leaves the rest of this repository fully public domain.

The mod is otherwise inert without Forbidden & Arcanus installed: it ships no
Forbidden & Arcanus code, blocks, items or other assets.
